<title>UK: Euro vacuum gas oil mirrors weaker energy complex.</title>
<headline>Euro vacuum gas oil mirrors weaker energy complex.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>bid/ask	prev bid/ask</p>
<p> Low sulphur cargoes fob NWE	  159/161	  163/164</p>
<p> High sulphur cargoes fob NWE	 146/148	  150/152</p>
<p> High sulphur barges fob ARA	  153/155	  157/159</p>
<p> Formula quotation fob Med	     08/12	    08/12</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Falling crude and gas oil futures combined to push vacuum gas oil down on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>With crude losing around $1.50 a barrel and gas oil down $15 a tonne buyers have been quietly watching screens looking for the market to bottom out before picking up material.</p>
<p>The weaker prices have closed the arbitrage to the U.S., but the scant interest cargoes are attracing in NWE may result in the arb being forced open in order to shift product.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
